{"unit_id":"liuGuanYi-hub__dsh-message-edit#readme-1","repo":"liuGuanYi-hub/dsh-message-edit","commit":"8f53406ae0582ea3d66e5b35c0bd960f420ec412","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-edit README · dsh-message-edit — DeepSeek Harness 用户消息修改与排队发送插件：<p align=\"left\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DeepSeek%20Harness-Plugin-0066FF?style=flat-square\" alt=\"DeepSeek Harness Plugin\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-v0.1.0-blue?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Version\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/platform-Web%20%2F%20Desktop-brightgreen?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Platform Web/Desktop\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green?style=flat-square\" alt=\"License MIT\">\n</p>","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-message-edit — DeepSeek Harness 用户消息修改与排队发送插件"}
{"unit_id":"liuGuanYi-hub__dsh-message-edit#readme-2","repo":"liuGuanYi-hub/dsh-message-edit","commit":"8f53406ae0582ea3d66e5b35c0bd960f420ec412","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-edit README · dsh-message-edit — DeepSeek Harness 用户消息修改与排队发送插件：> **原生体验 · 零源码侵入 · 用户消息一键修改回填 · Antigravity 同款排队发消息 · 极简黑鲸 Logo & 顶栏高度重构**\n\n`dsh-message-edit` 是为 [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai) Web 控制台及桌面端打造的增强插件。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-message-edit — DeepSeek Harness 用户消息修改与排队发送插件"}
{"unit_id":"liuGuanYi-hub__dsh-message-edit#readme-3","repo":"liuGuanYi-hub/dsh-message-edit","commit":"8f53406ae0582ea3d66e5b35c0bd960f420ec412","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-edit README · ✨ 核心特性：- ✏️ **一键修改提问（Edit Prompt）**：在用户历史消息右下角（复制按钮旁）无缝嵌入精致的「修改 (✎)」按钮，点击自动将纯净提问文本回填到底部输入框并聚焦。\n- ⚡ **Antigravity 同款排队发送（Queued Messages）**：在模型正在思考/生成/重试时，输入框内只要输入文字，右侧 Stop 按钮自动切换为蓝色「启动/发送（`↑`）」键，按回车即可加入待发队列，当前轮次结束后自动无缝发出。\n- 🐳 **极简黑鲸 Logo 呈现**：精简左上角品牌展示，仅保留官方经典的黑色小鲸鱼图标，视觉更纯净。\n- 🖥️ **舒适顶栏高度适配**：将桌面端顶部标题栏高度从紧凑的 24px 提升至舒展大气的 38px，控制键热区与字形更加协调。\n- 🪶 **零外部依赖 & 零源码补丁**：纯客户端动态插槽与 DOM 挂载，无需重新编译 DSH 官方源码。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"✨ 核心特性"}
{"unit_id":"liuGuanYi-hub__dsh-message-edit#readme-4","repo":"liuGuanYi-hub/dsh-message-edit","commit":"8f53406ae0582ea3d66e5b35c0bd960f420ec412","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-edit README · 本地安装（推荐）：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-message-edit\n```\n\n启动 DSH Web / 桌面端：\n\n```bash\ndsh --profile web\n```\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"本地安装（推荐）"}
